<td valign=3D"TOP" height=3D"28">
<font size=3D"2"></font><p><font size=3D"2">* An unpublished satire by Ben =
Graham, written in 1936 and given by the author to Warren Buffett in 1954.<=
/font></p></td>
<td width=3D"7%" valign=3D"TOP" height=3D"28"><p></p></td>
