<strong><p align=3D"CENTER">Some Thoughts on Selling Your Business*</p></st=
rong>
<table cellspacing=3D"0" border=3D"0" width=3D"600">
<tbody><tr><td width=3D"13%" valign=3D"TOP" height=3D"28">
